KZ3 patch 4023 (stage 3c, ENHANCEMENT, opt-in; network pass 40): the Custom pad layout per ACTION instead of per
game button. pad_action_custom.h (new, pure): 33 action groups (15 on foot, 18 vehicles / exo / guns) of the game's
EDeviceFunction ids, each on the scheme's own button, unbound or an EButton; bind with a swap when a conflicting group
holds the button (pairs the game's Standard / Alternate or Modern put together may share), clear, copy Default or
Modern into Custom (Modern copied gives exactly pad_actions.h's Modern on Standard and Alternate), keybinds.ini
[pad actions] (an older per-button Custom becomes groups), the page commands "kb:pa ..." and the controller
picture's labels. pad_actions.h: pab_sync_block_user takes the per-action table (pab_sync_block unchanged for its
callers). pad_keybinds.h: the section, the "pa" verb. cellPad.c: Custom writes the per-action table through 4022,
the page's capture runs next to 4014's, `[pad] custom per action: ...` log line.
Host test: tools/net/test_pad_action_custom.c. Pages: port/net/kz3_padpage.h. Notes: the RE notes s.34.
